{"id": "1540525752389345290", "channel_id": "1540333762062319707", "author_id": "1003567250218958848", "author_name": "morified53", "content": "People complained about it getting cancelled so they made slight adjustments and brought it back. Community is divided on this so saying nobody wanted it is not correct. It is a system that is not mandatory so you can still choose not to bind. But if you do, you get a lil extra stats with the downside of not being able to use it with other awakers. And you can still unbind so it is not permanent. Not having a downside is just a 50% mainstat buff to all covenants lol.", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T00:59:20.954000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1540333762062319707", "mentions": ["131543979471667200"], "reply_to": "1540341027041452134", "thread_title": "📜 V2.6.0 版本前瞻┊Version Outlook┊버전 미리보기", "forum_channel_id": "1355085076500578363", "thread_tags": ["1357267957901951088", "1357267999253467207"]}
